editor_description = "Bends the Head alone, and is deliberately the last child of the skeleton so it applies after the spine look-at and the hand IK. Narrower limits than the spine one (about 70 degrees across, 60 up and down) so a target behind the Player is simply not followed. Driven by Player.set_head_look_at_target, which is how the Player can read a screen while their hands keep typing."
